## Problem Framing

Develop an interpretable, validated model for December 2020 advertised sailboat prices using hull type, make, variant, length, geography, and manufacture year. Separate market description from prediction: estimate depreciation, size and location effects while predicting prices for observed-market and previously unseen designs.

The supplied excerpt ends mid-sentence, so any requirements beyond this scope are unavailable and must not be inferred.

